```mdl
verdict SearchQuery: No SearchQuery type exists; the query is a bare string passed to ObjectCombobox.searchQuery.
  status: missing
  note: Searched plugin-search and react-ui-search for a `SearchQuery` type; none. `SearchDialog` and `SearchArticle` hold a `string` in state, and the space comes from props, not from a `spaceId` field.
```

```mdl
verdict MatchField: No MatchField type exists; results carry a single snippet, not a list of matched fields.
  status: missing
  note: Searched plugin-search and react-ui-search. `toSearchResults` builds one `snippet` from `mapObjectToTextFields`, so a result does not name the field that matched.
```

```mdl
verdict SearchResult: The code's SearchResult has id, label, snippet, icon and object, not objectId, typeName and fields.
  status: diverged
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/ui/react-ui-search/src/types/SearchResult.ts#SearchResult, github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-search/src/hooks/search-query.ts#toSearchResults]
  note: The type lives in `@dxos/react-ui-search`. It has `id`, optional `type` (a kind such as "user"), `label`, `match`, `snippet`, `icon` and `object`. It has no typename and no `MatchField[]`.
```

