```mdl
verdict F-1.2: The query is debounced 200 ms, not 400 ms, and runs against the FTS5 index, not a regex over all objects.
  status: diverged
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/ui/react-ui-search/src/components/SearchList/SearchList.tsx, github:dxos/dxos/packages/sdk/app-toolkit/src/ui/components/ObjectCombobox/ObjectCombobox.tsx#searchQuery]
  note: |
    `SearchList.Root` debounces with `debounceMs = 200` and neither container overrides it. The query is
    `Filter.text(text, { type: 'full-text' })` scoped to listed user-facing types, so not all objects in the space match.
```

```mdl
verdict F-1.3: A row shows icon, label and a snippet; it does not show the matched field key.
  status: diverged
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-search/src/hooks/search-query.ts#toSearchResults]
  tests: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-search/src/hooks/search-query.test.ts]
  note: The match is FTS, not a regex. The snippet is `content`, `description` or the first field that is not the label, whichever is found, not the field that matched. The dialog rows show only icon and label.
```

